join renko center
renko: Dammit, she's not here either. Where did you go Merry?
renko: What am I supposed to do now?!
unknown: By the gods you’re a loud one.
renko: Huh?! Who?!
unknown: Oh good, you can hear me, which means-
join doremy center
unknown: You should be able to see me too.
renko: Geez forget who, what the heck are you?! And what’s with that outfit. Is that a tail?
unknown: Well…I see you’re pretty rude for a human, but considering your situation, I guess that's understandable. I, however, am not that rude so I will give you my name.
\doremy: I am Doremy Sweet, the Ruler of Dreams. And it’s a pleasure to meet you.
renko: Ruler…of dreams? Does this mean this place-
\doremy: Is a dream? Well, yes and no.
\doremy: One might call it more of a nightmare than a dream, but the border between them is very, very minor so it’s easy to pass between the two, both accidentally and intentionally.
renko: Dreams? Boarders? All of this sounds way too familiar. Ugh! Whatever, I don't care. Where’s Merry?! What have you done with my friend?!
\doremy: Oh, I haven’t done anything with her.
renko: Huh, then who-
\doremy: You need to talk to the mastermind behind this incident for that. I'm only here to guide you, your friendly baku guide!
renko: A baku…so you’re a youkai. Wait, were you the thing making those weird noises earlier?
\doremy: Noises? No, no. I just got here, so that wasn’t me. And personally I have no idea what it could be either.
renko: Great…so I still have to worry about that thing too. But whatever, what do you mean you’re my guide?
\doremy: Basically I’m here to answer your questions, oversee your progess, and tell you what to do.
\doremy: The mastermind behind both this phenomena and the disappearance of your friend has a series of…let’s call them trials for you to undergo.
renko: So Merry is being held hostage for some sort of game?!
\doremy: Yes.
renko: Grr…Fine, what do I have to do? What are these trials?
\doremy: You just need to wander around and solve a few puzzles, no big deal really.
\doremy: Well, you might undergo some deep, internal trauma and horrors beyond human understanding but you should, probably, be fine. Nothing physical should happen to you at least.
renko: How comforting…
\doremy: That’s the spirit!
renko: Ugh…
\doremy: The best advice I can give you right now is to head down that hallway over there. I'll stay here and provide emotional support every time you see my cute face!
renko: Okay. Thanks, I guess.
leave renko
\doremy: …
\doremy: I hope that creature she mentioned isn’t anything serious. I wasn’t told to add anything like that.